abstract: "Second v2.0 release candidate of memoria.ia. It adds persistent structural trajectories, evolving addresses, competing attractors, explicit temporal inference, a structured cognitive packet, epistemic admission and a versioned cognitive ABI to the RC1 structural baseline. Controlled address-level cases complete before language generation with zero LLM calls. General natural-language reasoning is not claimed."
